e, we could use his advice.\\nD) Their suggestion should be taken into consideration.\",],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 35,\n      \"question\": \"Which of these complex sentences uses ellipsis effectively? \\nA) After I finished my work, I went to bed.\\nB) Because it was raining heavily, we decided not to go out.,\\nC) When the bus arrived at the station, everyone boarded.\",\n      \"options\": [\"A) After I finished my work, I went to bed\", \"B) Because it was raining heavily, we decided not to go out\", \"C) When the bus arrived at the station, everyone boarded\", \"D) It's been a long day and I need some sleep\"],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
